      <h2 id="evidence-map">The evidence map</h2>

      <p>
        Every ingredient below is graded on the same basis: how consistently it has beaten placebo
        in randomised controlled trials for knee osteoarthritis or activity-related knee pain, and
        whether independent (non-industry) trials replicated the finding.
      </p>

